{"key": "e41a07b0fc1a20dd7d79e32a27a36e3a", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Yes, the Payment Link can be used for WhatsApp sales: it generates a link your customer pays online with card, Pix and debit, and it's described as ideal for sales via WhatsApp and social media [1]. You can also make sales using WhatsApp or your social network [2].\n\nThe passages don't state a daily sales cap (limit) for the Payment Link.\n\nMISSING: daily sales limit of the Payment Link", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011Cgh4E57WipjamMJyjGttZ", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4347, "output_tokens": 136, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-partial-04#0"}
{"key": "10b5077a7c0e92e1588612e9a365455b", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "A passagem [1] traz o preço da Get Smart: R$ 129,90/mês (a Get Clássica custa R$ 79,90/mês). Sobre as mensalidades dos aplicativos, [4] diz que elas são cobradas pelas empresas desenvolvedoras, e que para a Getnet são pagos o Aluguel e as Taxas Administrativas [4]. As fontes não trazem o prazo de garantia da Get Smart em meses.\n\nMISSING: prazo de garantia da Get Smart em meses", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011Cgh4E3cxdZ9kT8aQKnbU6", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4116, "output_tokens": 179, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-partial-01#0"}
{"key": "953d5ee1096e4f9b5d4bef337e3e0821", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "O Crediário da Getnet permite parcelar em até 48 vezes no cartão de crédito [1]. O prazo máximo e a taxa de juros do parcelamento variam conforme o emissor do cartão [2].\n\nAs passagens não trazem um percentual fixo de juros para o cliente. Elas dizem só que os juros podem variar de acordo com o emissor [1]. A taxa de desconto (MDR) cobrada do lojista pode ser consultada no Aplicativo Getnet Brasil ou no Portal do Cliente [1][3]. Para o lojista, o valor da venda é recebido em até 2 dias úteis, com taxa única e sem custo de antecipação [2].\n\nMISSING: percentual da taxa de juros do Crediário para o cliente (depende do emissor e não consta nas fontes)", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011Cgh4E5ekn6XN6YDynDTs5", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4939, "output_tokens": 277, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-partial-03#0"}
{"key": "0eccd61a56db6569ccb66aadc620f2e2", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Sim, para usar o Pix é preciso ter uma conta: o Pix funciona por conta corrente, poupança ou conta de pagamento pré-paga [4]. A Getnet oferece a Get Conta, uma conta digital gratuita para sua empresa, na qual é possível enviar e receber dinheiro e vender por meio do Pix [1].\n\nSobre o prazo, a abertura da Get Conta é feita na hora [5]. Para abrir, basta acessar o site, escolher uma máquina de aluguel ou compra e optar por receber as vendas na Conta. Sem máquina, também é possível abrir a conta para transferências, pagamentos de boletos e cartão pré-pago [5].", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011Cgh4E9UwbENupLHxZKweh", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4280, "output_tokens": 240, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-partial-05#0"}
{"key": "1a37720630f6539870c72f7a8ff9b944", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "The Get Clássica costs R$ 79,90 per month [1][2][5]. The passages do not give battery life in hours for the Get Clássica. The only battery guidance is for the Get Smart, a different model: charge it for at least 3 hours in a row, ideally when it reaches 20% [3]. That is a charging tip, not a battery life figure.\n\nMISSING: Get Clássica battery life in hours", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011Cgh4EBjcyg15CjLKANFcX", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4385, "output_tokens": 134, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-partial-02#0"}
{"key": "d617ec68632abec755429b64c43f8220", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Yes, you can send the Payment Link through WhatsApp. It generates a link that your customer pays online with card, Pix or debit. It's described as ideal for sales via WhatsApp and social media [prod-pagamentos-pelo-whatsapp-02][prod-link-de-pagamento-01].\n\nThe sources don't state a daily sales cap for the Payment Link. I can pass your question to a human agent if you'd like.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011Cgh4EDs7ukfPAW6FNZsXC", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3483, "output_tokens": 140, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "q-partial-04#0"}
{"key": "4e5efc1b076ae93d2bc24540e89e94bb", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "A Get Smart custa R$ 129,90/mês, e a Get Clássica custa R$ 79,90/mês [prod-ofertas-maquininha-11]. As mensalidades dos aplicativos são cobradas pelas empresas desenvolvedoras. À Getnet são pagos o Aluguel e as Taxas Administrativas [sup-duvidas-get-smart-12].\n\nAs fontes que consultei não trazem o prazo de garantia da Get Smart em meses. Se quiser, posso encaminhar você a um atendente humano para confirmar essa informação.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011Cgh4EFkxq5VXCja4APjBM", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3539, "output_tokens": 195, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "q-partial-01#0"}
